#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:1
msgid "矩阵乘法 （Matrix Multiplication）"
msgstr "Matrix Multiplication"

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:3
msgid "在本节中，我们展示了使用 Triton 进行矩阵乘法的内核实现。"
msgstr ""
"This section describes how to implement a matrix multiplication kernel"
"using Triton."

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:5
msgid "计算内核"
msgstr "Compute Kernel"

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"以下 Triton 内核实现了一个带偏置项的批量矩阵乘法（Batched Matrix Multiplication with Bias）：   "
"计算公式为：   $$ \\text{output}[b, i, j] = \\sum_k \\text{x}[b, i, k] \\cdot "
"\\text{y}[k, j] + \\text{z}[b, i, j] $$   其中："
msgstr ""
"The following Triton kernel implements batched matrix multiplication"
"with bias:"
"The formula is as follows: "
"$$ \\text{output}[b, i, j] = \\sum_k \\text{x}[b, i, k] \\cdot"
"\\text{y}[k, j] + \\text{z}[b, i, j] $$"
"Specifically:"

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:12
msgid "`x` 的形状为 `(A, B)`"
msgstr "The shape of `x` is `(A, B)`."

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:13
msgid "`y` 的形状为 `(B, C)`"
msgstr "The shape of `y` is `(B, C)`."

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:14
msgid "`z`（偏置）的形状为 `(A, C)`"
msgstr "The shape of `z` (bias) is `(A, C)`."

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:15
msgid "输出 `output` 的形状为 `(A, C)`"
msgstr "The shape of `output` is `(A, C)`."

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:17
msgid "该内核假设单个 block 负责整个输出矩阵的计算，适用于小规模矩阵（A、B、C 较小且能被当前程序块完全覆盖）。"
msgstr ""
"This kernel assumes that a single block is responsible for computing the"
"entire output matrix. It is applicable to small-scale matrices (A, B,"
"and C are small and can be fully covered by the current program block)."

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:64
msgid "工具方法"
msgstr "Tools and Methods"

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:66
msgid "以下辅助函数用于支持 Triton 内核的测试与验证，包括 PyTorch 参考实现、数据类型映射、随机张量生成及结果校验。"
msgstr ""
"The following helper functions are used to support the testing and"
"verification of Triton kernels, including PyTorch reference"
"implementation, data type mapping, random tensor generation, and result"
"verification."

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:127
msgid "参数化测试"
msgstr "Parameterized Test"

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:129
msgid "使用 `pytest` 对 `triton_dot_2_Bias` 内核进行参数化功能验证，覆盖不同矩阵维度和数据类型组合。"
msgstr ""
"Use `pytest` to verify the parameterization function of the"
"`triton_dot_2_Bias` kernel, covering different combinations of matrix"
"dimensions and data types."

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:175
msgid "**输出示例：**"
msgstr "**Output example:**"

#: ../../zh/examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md:181
msgid "上面输出日志表明Triton和Pytorch上的输出结果完全一致。"
msgstr ""
"The preceding logs indicate that the output on Triton is the same as"
"that on PyTorch."
